      "solution": "[1단계] $A=\\{3,~5,~7\\}$, $B=\\{1,~3,~7,~21\\}$이므로\n$A \\cup B = \\{1,~3,~5,~7,~21\\}$, $A \\cap B = \\{3,~7\\}$\n[2단계] $(A \\cup B)-(A \\cap B) = \\{1,~5,~21\\}$이다.",
